# Curated artefact -- Phase 4, QHV twin leg, 2x2 probe (b) (2026-09-09).
# RESULT: STILL HANGS. QEMU 6.2.0, rng correctly in slot 3 (+ virtio-net slot filler).
# Entropy init now SUCCEEDS (no devr-virtio / /dev/random failure lines) and the boot gets to
